#. DiseasesExpanded.STRINGS.RANDOM_EVENTS.GREAT_BOG_BUG_MIGRATION.TOAST_END
msgctxt "DiseasesExpanded.STRINGS.RANDOM_EVENTS.GREAT_BOG_BUG_MIGRATION.TOAST_END"
