#. DiseasesExpanded.STRINGS.RANDOM_EVENTS.NIGHT_OF_THE_LIVING_DEAD.TOAST
msgctxt "DiseasesExpanded.STRINGS.RANDOM_EVENTS.NIGHT_OF_THE_LIVING_DEAD.TOAST"
