#. DiseasesExpanded.STRINGS.RANDOM_EVENTS.PRINT_SOME_GERMS.TOAST
msgctxt "DiseasesExpanded.STRINGS.RANDOM_EVENTS.PRINT_SOME_GERMS.TOAST"
